      "message": "@lorenzo@google.com\n\nThe `PrivateAddressCoordinator` is depending on 2 fields of `TetheringConfiguration`:\n- [mRandomPrefixBase](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Connectivity/Tethering/src/com/android/networkstack/tethering/TetheringConfiguration.java;l\u003d297;drc\u003dc512ab7e23ec82c7354d2c1fdb97db76a516c6ce), from DeviceConfig\n- [mEnableWifiP2pDedicatedIp](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Connectivity/Tethering/src/com/android/networkstack/tethering/TetheringConfiguration.java;l\u003d289;drc\u003dc512ab7e23ec82c7354d2c1fdb97db76a516c6ce), from Tethering resources.\n\nThe problem is that the `RoutingCoordinatorService` could be created by `ConnectivityService` so it may not be able to get the `TetheringConfiguration` or read `Tethering`\u0027s resource. What\u0027s the suggested way to solve this?",
